WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.020
What's wrong?

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.270
I-It's them.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.150
Run... This is their territory!

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.320
The Aooniyanma...

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.940
<b> Shinnakamachi 
Magistrate's 
Office</b>

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:34.930
Insect Magistrate...

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:37.080
Regarding our request

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.340
that Tsukishima Genjuurou, the master Tsugaru
 swordsman, join the Insect Magistrate's...

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.240
He can no longer move.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.610
And thus, we've accepted his son, 
Tsukishima Jinbei instead.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.870
I hope he will

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.010
contribute to the peace of Edo.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.720
<b>My rival is female 
ninja, Hibachi!</b>

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.850
Where am I?

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:09.130
M-Mugai-san...

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:18.100
I'll be a strong samurai who keeps 
winning until the day he dies!

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:18.910
Indeed.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.330
What a terrible dream...

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:36.600
Good morning, Sun-sama!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.340
Today's going to be another great day!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.720
Tsukishima Jinbei...

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:45.350
It's his fault.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.270
The weather's nice today.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.280
Jinbei-sama, good luck at your new job.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.410
Well, it's time for morning training.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.670
Three thousand swings.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.410
Begin!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:10.030
<i>Today, I finally start my job at 
the Insect Magistrate's Office.</i>

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.500
<i>Father, watch over me.</i>

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:17.060
<i>I, Tsukishima Jinbei, 
will succeed in my duties, and live up</i>

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:21.260
<i>to the expectations of those in Edo and of 
my fellow Insect Magistrate's members!</i>

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.010
<i>And Mugai-dono...</i>

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.880
<i>To repay you for saving me...</i>

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.710
<i>And above all, to be more like you,</i>

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.900
<i>I will become stronger!</i>

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.270
Jeez.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.970
What a horrible start to a day...

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.450
Good morning, Hibachi-dono!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.620
Time for the morning meeting.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.450
Oh, I'm sorry... Were you changing?

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.190
I'll go on ahead, then.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.910
You pervert!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:08.670
Guess the new kid's a morning person.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.230
He won't last long anyway...

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.110
Jinbei-kun,

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.530
how are your injuries?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.910
I'm just fine, thanks to you!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.660
I'm glad to hear it.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.200
Oh, Mugai-dono...

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.640
Good morning!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.480
M-M-Mugai-san,

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.590
g-good morning!

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:55.480
Right, since everyone's here, let's start by

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.080
explaining to Jinbei-kun our work here.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:58.730
Please!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.910
I think you learned this yesterday,

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:09.400
but Japan is filled with giant 
bugs that eat humans.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.910
They first appeared about a century ago.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.820
Why are they here?

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:18.000
How did it happen?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.990
Where did they come from?

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.000
We are still investigating.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.260
Then, the thing I ran into all those years ago...

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.960
Was probably an insect.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.370
However, Tsugaru,
 where you are from,

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:34.700
as well as the Oushuu region,
 have very cold climates,

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.770
and are not thought to be infested.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.260
And ten years ago,

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:46.310
the Shinnakamachi Magistrate, 
or the Insect Magistrate's Office,

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.530
was created to protect Edo from them.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:54.140
We work for the Insect Magistrate, 
fighting bugs every day.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.510
And where is the Insect Magistrate?

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:00.790
I'd like to meet him!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.090
That's unnecessary.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:08.090
The Insect Magistrate does not 
reveal himself to others.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.450
No way a new kid could meet him.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.720
Even we've never met him.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:16.130
Really?

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:18.980
Do you understand now, Jinbei-kun?

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.980
The peace of Edo rests on your shoulders.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:31.660
<i>Those are the finest words a 
Samurai could hope to hear!</i>

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:39.000
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall fulfill the duty 
appointed to me by the Shogunate!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:45.750
I will do my very best, and I look forward 
to working with each of you!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.690
As a fellow defender of Edo,

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.800
I shall do all I can to meet your expectations.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.560
Expectations, huh?

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.560
T-Trouble, Matsunohara-sama!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.850
An insect has been reported!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.190
Where?

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.850
It went west from Tachikawa, 
but that's all we know.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:07.010
All right, we'll split up and search.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:08.490
Everyone!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.200
Right!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:12.910
Oh, Jinbei-kun,

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.620
you'll be sidelined for a while.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:17.200
Huh?

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.200
It's fine if you don't fight...

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.530
Please wait!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.590
Why can't I fight?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:29.250
I'm a member of the Magistrate's Office, too!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.870
W-Well...

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:31.840
Clearly,

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.930
it's because you're weak.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.470
Maybe you thought you were special 
'cause you got lucky and killed a spider,

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:45.060
but no one here expects anything from you.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:48.820
If you have a home to return to, 
you should leave.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.680
M-Mugai-dono, not you, too...

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.080
Jinbei-kun,

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:02.930
no newcomer to the Magistrate's Office

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:07.440
in the past year has lasted even ten days.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:12.390
We cannot waste time searching 
for additional personnel.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:17.850
Thus, for the next month, you are 
forbidden to draw your blade.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.810
As your leader, that is my order.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.060
Understood...

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.670
Why did I have to team up with you?

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.420
What are you thinking about?

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:45.480
I was thinking about Mugai-dono.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:50.420
To me, he is a star, 
shining in the night sky!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.670
He is the man I want to be.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.430
So you want to be like him, too?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.810
What do you mean by "too," Hibachi-dono?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.570
Nothing.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:08.650
Do you feel the same way about him that I do—

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.860
It's not the same!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:14.240
I've wanted to be like him 
for a far, far longer time!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.250
What?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:20.230
What is Mugai-dono like?

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.820
You don't know anything?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.400
Tell me, please.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.250
Mugai-san is...

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.500
a master of the blade like no other.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.630
Yes!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.510
What else?

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:35.530
Hmm...

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.150
One rumor says that before 
the Insect Magistrate's,

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:42.550
he worked for an organization 
called the Insect Hunters.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:43.930
Insect Hunters?

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:46.350
A group of powerful warriors.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.850
I've heard that they're sometimes 
hired to take out the bugs,

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.440
but no one really knows.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.530
Those are just rumors, though.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.230
And being so mysterious is just 
another great thing about him!

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:00.180
Right...

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.600
That's why I look up to him.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.540
Well, I look up to him even more!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.960
We'll see about that!

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:11.290
Listen, he's really strong.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.100
I know.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:16.170
After all, he saved my life.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.680
He saved my life, too!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.230
He did?

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.690
What?

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:25.430
Please tell me about it!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.440
You want to hear it?

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.150
I do!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:34.600
A year ago, I left my village.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.940
Where is your village?

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:41.200
It's a hidden ninja village that 
borders Iga and Koga.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.780
Oh, then you don't practice 
Iga-style or Koga-style.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:46.280
Which style do you use?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.220
W-Well...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.340
It doesn't matter.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.330
Anyway!

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:56.030
We were known as the strongest ninjas

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:58.880
when it came to the use of explosives.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.330
Were known?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.020
Yeah, a long time ago.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.850
After the civil wars ended,

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.520
no one needed ninjas anymore.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:10.010
When I was young, everyone had 
already taken normal jobs.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:14.610
However,

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.040
my grandfather, the head of the clan,

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.510
was the only one who continued to train.

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:24.120
<i>Just come down to the village...</i>

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:27.980
<i>Getting stronger is pointless now.</i>

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:29.710
<i>No one needs ninjas anymore.</i>

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.400
<i>Leave!</i>

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.860
<i>I said to leave.</i>

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:39.970
<i>Hibachi...</i>

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.280
<i>Visiting your grandfather again?</i>

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:42.970
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.930
<i>He's such a softy when it comes 
to his granddaughter.</i>

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.610
<i>It's the one way he's like a normal old man.</i>

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.490
<i>Here, I made you an onigiri!</i>

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.340
<i>Well done, Hibachi-chan.</i>

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:18.540
I loved my grandfather.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.580
And that smile that was only for me.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:26.600
And the way he devoted his life to strength.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:32.480
Before long, I decided I also wanted to be strong.

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:38.900
And several years ago,

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:42.650
Kotori-san heard about a young female ninja,

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.320
and came to recruit me.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.690
<i>I'm gonna do it, Grandpa.</i>

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:55.070
<i>I'm gonna go work for the 
Insect Magistrate's Office.</i>

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.540
<i>If I do well there,</i>

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.000
<i>maybe people will start to study your style again.</i>

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:03.440
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.370
<i>The clan style is a man's thing...</i>

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.600
<i>A man's thing!</i>

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.360
<i>I didn't teach you so that you'd carry it on!</i>

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.070
Even so,

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:22.280
I wanted to preserve the style 
my grandpa spent his life on.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:28.450
That's why I decided to join 
the Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.660
And then came my first opponent...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.800
Mugai-san saved my life!

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:54.240
I fell in love with his strength.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.900
I realized Edo has some truly strong people.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:07.110
And someday, I want to be strong enough

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.810
to gain Mugai-san's acceptance, 
and to repay him.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.340
If I can be that strong, I'm sure...

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:15.000
Wow, you're just like me...

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.940
When Mugai-dono saved me,

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.000
I saw the truth of my father's words!

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:23.730
That a samurai can never lose,

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.600
to keep those behind him from being afraid.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:35.430
Mugai-dono's overwhelming strength 
makes those behind him feel safe!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:44.900
Then and there, I decided that 
I would make him my goal.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.990
That's the kind of guy he is, right?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.490
He makes you think you want to be like him.

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:51.990
Right!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.120
He's cool, isn't he?

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:53.590
Yes.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:54.220
He's wonderful, isn't he?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:54.670
Yes.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:55.710
He's the best, isn't he?

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:56.330
Yes.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:01.170
Wait, why am I discussing 
Mugai-san with you, anyway?!

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.290
Don't get cocky.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.350
H-Hibachi-dono...

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.930
What's wrong?

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.320
I-It's them.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.620
Run! This is their territory!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.330
Whose?

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:39.540
<b>Aooniyanma - Demon Dragonfly</b>

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.330
The Aooniyanma...

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.280
It's a type of dragonfly.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.000
Like other dragonflies,

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.010
it claims a river area as its territory.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.810
And when the sun falls, and it gets cool,

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.970
it takes flight, in search of prey.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.640
You know a lot about them, Hibachi-dono!

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:03.790
Of course I do.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:04.810
Because it's the

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:09.070
same insect I fought my first time!

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.030
What?

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.880
Tsukishima, get those two out of here.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:17.180
B-But, Hibachi-dono, you can't fight alone...

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.000
Weren't you told not to draw your sword?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.370
And besides, this is the perfect chance.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:26.170
This time, I'll defeat it on my own!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.010
Tsukishima, hurry!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:31.850
Right!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:32.880
Good luck!

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:37.390
Here I go, Aooni.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.180
<i>During that first fight,</i>

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:45.190
<i>all I could do was sit,
 shaking, behind Mugai-san.</i>

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.980
<i>But I'm not like that anymore.</i>

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:56.570
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms!</i>

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:05.370
<i>I'm not the same person I was then.</i>

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.220
This is it!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.910
<i>I'll defeat it on my own, and I'll prove that!</i>

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.000
Fine with me!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.690
The fire...

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.450
Oh, no!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.520
M-Mugai-san...

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:09.650
Are you all right, Hibachi-dono?

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.370
T-Tsukishima!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:14.280
I got those two out of here, as ordered.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.730
Let's go!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.850
W-Wait...

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.200
It's my prey.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.280
I'll kill it!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.210
I must do this myself.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:34.990
If I can prove my strength, 
Mugai-san will accept me.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.470
You stay back!

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:37.970
I refuse!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:47.230
This job is not the place to prove your strength.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.610
I'm sure Mugai-dono would feel the same.

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:54.390
You understand that, don't you, Hibachi-dono?

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.260
Because both of us

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:01.410
were drawn to him by his pure fighting style.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.340
I didn't want to hear that from you, but...

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.840
That's fine.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.050
Let's go, Tsukishima.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.350
We'll finish it off fast!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:24.680
Right!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.620
Always be ready for a fight!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.740
<i>Secret Technique: Thousand Bladed Flowers!</i>

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.970
Hibachi-dono, how's the water?

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:09.980
Not hot enough.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.290
Okay.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:21.400
<i>Jinbei-kun, did you draw your sword?</i>

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.530
<i>I...</i>

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.150
<i>No.</i>

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.410
<i>He did not.</i>

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.440
<i>Well, he didn't remove it from the sheath.</i>

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.990
By the way, Hibachi-dono...

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:32.790
What?

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:36.470
Your explosion techniques today were splendid.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.800
What's the name of your style?

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:42.750
You won't tell anyone?

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:44.170
Of course not.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.390
Then, I'll tell you.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.220
What did you say?

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.270
I told you!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.020
Chinpou-Style...

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.040
Chinpou-Style?!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.630
D-Did you say Chinpou-Style?

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:01.990
You're being too loud...

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.210
Wow.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:12.290
You pervert!

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.720
Perhaps they're getting along a bit better.

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.110
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:02.110
To master the blade, you must use konjac.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:03.200
Konjac?

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:03.790
Yes!

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:05.030
I must start training.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:08.400
Oharu-dono, please lend me 
those two big konjac balls.

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:10.120
Oh, Jinbei-sama...

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:11.610
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:14.000
The Killer of 99, Koikawa Shungiku.

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Killer of 99, Koikawa Shungiku!</b>
